   Kendall, H.; Kuznesof, S.; Raley, M.; Clark, B.; Frewer, L. J., Newcastle Univ, Sch Nat \& Environm Sci, Newcastle Upon Tyne, Tyne \& Wear, England.
   Naughton, P., Edinburgh Napier Univ, Business Sch, Craiglockhart Campus, Edinburgh, Midlothian, Scotland.
