   Hoverman, Jason/0000-0002-4002-2728
   Richgels, Katherine/0000-0003-2834-9477},
Funding-Acknowledgement = {Morris Animal Foundation; NFWF Wildlife Links Program; David and Lucile
   Packard Foundation; Colorado Parks and Wildlife; Colorado Wildlife
   Conservation Grant Program},
Funding-Text = {For their efforts in the field, we thank A. Peterson, A. Jensen, E.
   Daly, D. Herasimtschuk, E. Holldorf, R. Adams, R. Hovel, R. Jadin, K.
   Dorsa, L. Juliusson, R. Parkhill and L. Arellano. We further acknowledge
