Abstract = {The irruption of the tourist rental, like the one offered on Airbnb, has
   brought profound changes around housing and urban spaces. Madrid has
   become the hand of the tourist rental, among other reasons, in a
   successful touristic city. This article analyses the proliferation of
   tourist rentals in the Central district of Madrid and its impact on
   residential rentals. In this case, as in other European and North
   American cities, the tourist exploitation of the houses has allowed to
   open the rent gap, while the rental price of the houses has skyrocketed.},
