   Zhang, Shun; del Alamo, Juan C., Univ Calif San Diego, Mech \& Aerosp Engn Dept, La Jolla, CA 92093 USA.
   Guy, Robert D., Univ Calif Davis, Dept Math, Davis, CA 95616 USA.},
